              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "书房 — shūfáng — \"study; a room for books and work\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "我的书都在书房里 wǒ de shū dōu zài shūfáng lǐ — All my books are in the study."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 房 (fáng) — eight strokes in two pieces: on top a door of four strokes (a dot, a horizontal that turns down, a horizontal closing it, a long stroke falling to the left), and under it the four strokes of the piece read fāng. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
            }
          ]
        },
